    <!--
        The credit line, and the only piece of branding the app carries.

        It used to read "made with love for Iranian gamers", which narrowed the
        game to one market it was never built for. The replacement is a plain
        signature with no border on it — and it is deliberately the *only* line
        of its kind in the app: the version number, the "about" blurb and the
        language row that used to sit around it are gone, because a settings
        screen full of prose about the app is a screen nobody reads. The one
        thing a player might actually want from it is who made it, and that is
        the GitHub card directly above.
    -->
